{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25953","headline":"秋夜对月怀李正封 · 鲍溶","name":"秋夜对月怀李正封","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"援琴怅独立，高月对秋堂。\n美人远於月，徒望空景光。\n坐忆执手时，七弦起凄凉。\n平生知音少，君子安可忘。\n客意如梦寐，路岐遍四方。\n日远迷所之，满天心暗伤。\n主奉二鲤鱼，中含五文章。\n惜无千金荅，愁思盈中肠。\n此夕临风叹，零露沾衣裳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25953.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25953","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}